{"PageNumber":498,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":40,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّ يَوۡمَ ٱلۡفَصۡلِ مِيقَٰتُهُمۡ أَجۡمَعِينَ","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ يَوْمَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْفَصْلِ مِيقَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تُهُمْ أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>مَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٠</span>","End":"٤٠","PageNumber":498,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":432,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":41,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يَوۡمَ لَا يُغۡنِي مَوۡلًى عَن مَّوۡلٗى شَيۡـٔٗا وَلَا هُمۡ يُنصَرُونَ","TajweedText":"يَوْمَ لَا يُغْنِى مَوْلًى ع<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن م</tajweed>َّوْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>لًى ش</tajweed>َيْـ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ـًٔا و</tajweed>َلَا هُمْ يُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نص</tajweed>َر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤١</span>","End":"٤١","PageNumber":498,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":432,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":42,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِلَّا مَن رَّحِمَ ٱللَّهُۚ إِنَّهُۥ هُوَ ٱلۡعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","TajweedText":"إِلَّا م<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>َن ر</tajweed>َّحِمَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهُ‌ۚ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> هُوَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعَزِيزُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رَّح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مُ <span class=end>٤٢</span>","End":"٤٢","PageNumber":498,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":432,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumbe