":433,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":51,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّ ٱلۡمُتَّقِينَ فِي مَقَامٍ أَمِينٖ","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُتَّقِينَ فِى مَقَامٍ أَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نٍ <span class=end>٥١</span>","End":"٥١","PageNumber":498,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":433,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":52,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فِي جَنَّـٰتٖ وَعُيُونٖ","TajweedText":"فِى جَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>تٍ و</tajweed>َعُي<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نٍ <span class=end>٥٢</span>","End":"٥٢","PageNumber":498,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":433,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":53,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يَلۡبَسُونَ مِن سُندُسٖ وَإِسۡتَبۡرَقٖ مُّتَقَٰبِلِينَ","TajweedText":"يَلْبَسُونَ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن س</tajweed>ُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ند</tajweed>ُ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>سٍ و</tajweed>َإِسْتَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>رَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>قٍ م</tajweed>ُّتَقَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>بِل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٣</span>","End":"٥٣","PageNumber":498,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":433,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":54,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"كَذَٰلِكَ وَزَوَّجۡنَٰهُم بِحُورٍ عِينٖ","TajweedText":"كَذ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِكَ وَزَوَّ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>نَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ه<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِحُورٍ ع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نٍ <span class=end>٥٤</span>","End":"٥٤","PageNumber":498,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":433,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":55,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يَدۡعُونَ فِيهَا بِكُلِّ فَٰكِهَةٍ ءَامِنِينَ","TajweedText":"يَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>عُونَ فِيهَا بِكُلِّ فَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>كِهَةٍ ءَامِن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٥</span>","End":"٥٥","PageNumber":498,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":433,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":56,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"لَا يَذُوقُونَ فِيهَا ٱلۡمَوۡتَ إِلَّا ٱلۡمَوۡتَةَ ٱلۡأُولَىٰۖ وَوَقَىٰهُمۡ عَذَابَ ٱلۡجَحِيمِ","TajweedText":"لَا يَذُوقُونَ فِيهَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَوْتَ إِلَّا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَوْتَةَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأُولَىٰ‌ۖ وَوَقَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُمْ عَذَابَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْجَح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مِ <span class=end>٥٦</span>","End":"٥٦","PageNumber":498,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":433,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":57,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَضۡلٗا مِّن رَّبِّكَۚ ذَٰلِكَ هُوَ ٱلۡفَوۡزُ ٱلۡعَظِيمُ","TajweedText":"فَضْل<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>اً م</tajweed>ّ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ِن ر</tajweed>َّبِّكَ‌ۚ ذ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِكَ هُوَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْفَوْزُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعَظ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مُ <span class=end>٥٧</span>","En